029800* PERIODIC COMMIT                                                *
029900* ---------------------------------------------------------------*
030000 6000-COMMIT-CHECK.
030100     ADD 1 TO WS-SINCE-COMMIT
030200     IF WS-SINCE-COMMIT >= WS-COMMIT-FREQ
030300         EXEC SQL
030400             COMMIT
030500         END-EXEC
030600         MOVE ZERO TO WS-SINCE-COMMIT
030700     END-IF
030800     .
